        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# A Webhook That Answers\n\nReceives an HTTP POST and replies with a one-sentence summary of the event. Use it to turn raw webhook payloads into a line a person can act on.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Webhook\" hands its request body to \"2 Body as text\", a Code node that converts it to a JSON string. \"3 Summarize\" is an Agent that states what happened and whether it needs attention. \"4 Summary\" shows the sentence.\n\n**Try this:** Pick a model on \"3 Summarize\", register the workflow to get a delivery URL, then POST a sample body from your payment or CI service."
        },
